  "body": "Deadline sale: Closes on Wednesday 11 November 2026 at 3:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nPositioned on one of Long Bay's most prestigious streets, this exceptional residence enjoys breathtaking, uninterrupted sea views stretching across Long Bay Regional Park and the sparkling coastline beyond.\r\n\r\nSet in the very heart of Long Bay, with the vibrant Long Bay Village just moments from your doorstep, this is a rare address where spectacular coastal scenery meets everyday convenience. A location this special is seldom found.\r\n\r\nOccupying a generous 522m² freehold site, this architecturally designed home offers approximately 425m² of total floor area, including a 10m² balcony. Every element has been thoughtfully considered, striking a beautiful balance between understated luxury, impressive proportions and genuine everyday practicality.\r\n\r\nAn Exceptional Layout:\r\n• Five luxurious bedroom suites, each with its own ensuite and walk-in wardrobe\r\n• Two spacious living areas and two beautifully appointed kitchens\r\n• Separate laundry, abundant pantry space and cleverly integrated storage\r\n• Double internal-access garage\r\n\r\nArchitectural Elegance, Inside and Out\r\n\r\nA striking combination of brick veneer and contrasting fibre-cement cladding creates a bold yet timeless street presence. From the grand double-door entrance to the low-maintenance composite decking and fencing, every detail has been carefully considered.\r\n\r\nInside, natural oak-toned cabinetry meets soft ivory benchtops and splashbacks, creating a sophisticated yet welcoming atmosphere. Statement stone finishes around the fireplace and throughout the bathrooms add a distinctive touch of luxury.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen is equipped with premium Miele appliances, including an integrated Miele refrigerator - reflecting a commitment to quality without compromise.\r\n\r\nBeyond its impressive appearance, this is a home designed around the way people truly live. Generous storage, intuitive spaces and thoughtful finishing touches make everyday living as effortless as it is elegant.\r\n\r\nConveniently located near Long Bay School and Long Bay College, with beautiful beaches, coastal walks, the Regional Park and Long Bay Village all close at hand.\r\n\r\nExceptional views. An irreplaceable location. A home of true distinction.\r\n\r\nContact us to arrange your private viewing.",
